      "text": "browser_open url=\"https://example.com/\"\nbrowser_state target_id=… tab_id=…\nbrowser_click ref=\"p1:2\"\nbrowser_type  ref=\"p1:5\" text=\"hello\" replace=true\nbrowser_pointer action=\"scroll\" delta_y=-600\n```"
